1
00:01:12,830 --> 00:01:13,630
Hey.

2
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:14,600
How did it

3
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,230
calm down on its own?

4
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:17,660
Miss,

5
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:18,330
what

6
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,360
did you do?

7
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:21,630
I

8
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,060
don't know.

9
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,330
I just blocked it.

10
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:27,360
My wife,

11
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,100
did you see that?

12
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:30,130
You just raised your hand,

13
00:01:30,130 --> 00:01:31,600
and that cow knelt right down.

14
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,830
This is what they call subduing the enemy without fighting.

15
00:01:33,830 --> 00:01:35,360
This is what they call the aura of a king.

16
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:35,930
This is what they call...

17
00:01:35,930 --> 00:01:36,860
It didn't kneel.

18
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:38,360
It just lay down.

19
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:40,560
Lying down is almost the same as kneeling.

20
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,690
What does this mean?

21
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:44,130
It means you have a noble spirit in you.

22
00:01:44,729 --> 00:01:45,930
Even a cow can feel it.

23
00:01:46,060 --> 00:01:47,500
In the face of absolute power,

24
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:49,900
even the craziest beast has to yield.

25
00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:54,930
Did I really do it?

26
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:56,060
Absolutely.

27
00:01:56,430 --> 00:01:57,800
I saw the whole thing.

28
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,560
That cow rushed to you,

29
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,160
and was subdued by just one look from you.

30
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,430
This is what they call heroic.

31
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:03,800
This is what they call a woman who is as good as a man.

32
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:04,930
How can I, Cangyuan,

33
00:02:05,130 --> 00:02:06,630
be so lucky to marry such a woman?

34
00:02:06,630 --> 00:02:07,400
Alright.

35
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:08,520
That's enough.

36
00:02:08,729 --> 00:02:11,390
If you say one more word, I'll remarry tomorrow.

37
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,090
Thank you, Miss.

38
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,500
Thank you, Miss.

39
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:18,360
This beast went crazy this morning for some reason.

40
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,430
I almost thought someone was going to die.

41
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:21,890
Miss, you must be a master.

42
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:23,400
I didn't.

43
00:02:23,930 --> 00:02:25,500
I really didn't do anything.

44
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:26,630
No need to be modest.

45
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,760
Masters are all like my wife.

46
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,400
Doing good deeds without leaving a name.

47
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,200
Low-key.

48
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,100
Reserved.

49
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,020
Having the demeanor of a general.

50
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:37,400
Let's go.

51
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,360
Stop making a fool of yourself.

52
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,829
Where is the pancake stall?

53
00:02:40,829 --> 00:02:42,000
Just around the corner.

54
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,700
My wife,

55
00:02:42,829 --> 00:02:45,230
if you used that move on the battlefield,

56
00:02:45,329 --> 00:02:46,329
wouldn't it be...

57
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:49,329
If you keep bragging, I won't cook for you tonight.

58
00:02:50,829 --> 00:02:52,360
My wife is going to cook for me.

59
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,160
Oh my god.

60
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:06,960
Your Majesty,

61
00:03:07,330 --> 00:03:09,530
the spy found this in the mortal market.

62
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:12,230
A hairpin.

63
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,420
Is it worth bringing to me?

64
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,660
Where the hairpin was,

65
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,000
there were traces of spiritual power.

66
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,030
I have compared it,

67
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:21,700
and it matches the spiritual power fluctuation

68
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:22,860
of the God of War Baili.

69
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:23,660
Your Majesty,

70
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:26,260
Baili's divine bone has been stripped.

71
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:28,030
She is no different from a useless person.

72
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:29,490
Even if she is still alive,

73
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,460
she can't make any waves.

74
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:32,790
But she is still alive.

75
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:34,400
Being alive

76
00:03:34,930 --> 00:03:35,960
is a variable.

77
00:03:38,430 --> 00:03:39,560
Pass down the order.

78
00:03:39,829 --> 00:03:41,760
Block all exits of the Demon Realm,

79
00:03:41,930 --> 00:03:42,590
and search.

80
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,260
I want to see her alive,

81
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,600
or see her dead body.

82
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:46,900
Also,

83
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:50,800
find out who the man beside her is.

84
00:03:51,829 --> 00:03:52,500
Yes.

85
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,260
You're actually still alive.

86
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:58,400
It seems I went too easy on you.

87
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:12,260
Eat slowly.

88
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,960
No one is fighting you for it.

89
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:15,000
That won't do.

90
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,860
My wife bought it for me.

91
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:18,130
I have to finish it while it's hot.

92
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:18,800
If it gets cold,

93
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:21,000
I'd be letting down my wife's kindness.

94
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:25,960
Where do you get all this twisted logic all day?

95
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,300
What's wrong with twisted logic?

96
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:29,100
As long as it makes my wife happy,

97
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,200
twisted logic is also the truth.

98
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:36,300
Dealing with that brute today was dangerous enough.

99
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:38,500
Zhaohan's nose is sharper than a dog's.

100
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:41,020
We probably can't stay here for much longer.

101
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:42,930
My wife,

102
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,460
let's go somewhere else tomorrow.

103
00:04:44,460 --> 00:04:46,330
I heard there's a wild lake in the west of the Demon Realm

104
00:04:46,330 --> 00:04:47,330
called Qiyue Lake.

105
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:48,130
The water is sweet,

106
00:04:48,130 --> 00:04:48,760
the fish are dumb,

107
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,560
and you can catch one every time.

108
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,760
Let's go stay there for a couple of days.

109
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:53,960
What are you plotting again?

110
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,760
I'm innocent.

111
00:04:55,030 --> 00:04:56,460
I just want to take you out for a good meal.

112
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:58,200
I'm completely innocent. Heaven is my witness.

113
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,060
Qiyue Lake.

114
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:02,130
Legend has it that on a full moon night,

115
00:05:02,130 --> 00:05:04,400
the lake surface gathers the moon into the water.

116
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:06,630
It looks like the moon is sleeping in the water,

117
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:07,830
so it's called Qiyue.

118
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,130
I've wanted to take you to see it for a long time.

119
00:05:10,130 --> 00:05:12,660
That sounds more interesting than this market.

120
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:13,260
All right.

121
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,630
We'll leave tomorrow morning.

122
00:05:14,630 --> 00:05:14,960
Okay.

123
00:05:16,260 --> 00:05:17,830
Then I'll pack our things tonight.
